1. GRANT
The author grants the individual healthcare professional (nurse,
pharmacist, physician or other healthcare practitioner, natural person) a
free, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to install and use
the application on their own personal devices, as an aid to their own
checking of medicine expiry dates. Whoever uses the application takes
responsibility for its use.

2. PROHIBITED USES
Without the author's prior written agreement, the following are prohibited:
  a) use, adoption or deployment by healthcare companies, hospitals,
     clinics, nursing homes, care homes, pharmacies, cooperatives,
     corporations or any other public or private organization, even free of
     charge;
  b) installation on corporate devices or making the application available
     to the staff of an organization;
  c) selling, reselling, renting, sublicensing or redistributing the
     application or any part of it;
  d) modifying, decompiling, reverse engineering or creating derivative
     works, except as mandatorily permitted by law.

3. SOURCE CODE
The code is published on GitHub so that it can be read and checked.
GitHub's Terms of Service allow GitHub users to view it and fork it on the
platform; any other use of the code is governed by section 2.

4. NO WARRANTY
The application is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind, express
or implied. It is not a medical device: the date and batch read by the
camera must always be checked on the box, and the application does not
replace the records, procedures and responsibilities set by the
organization. To the maximum extent permitted by law, the author shall not
be liable for any damage arising from the use of, or inability to use, the
application.

5. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
The third-party components in the application (Dart packages, Android
libraries, components inside Google ML Kit and Google Play services, fonts)
and the medicine data of the Italian Medicines Agency (CC BY 4.0) remain
under their own licenses, listed in the application (Impostazioni ›
Licenze); those that Flutter does not collect by itself are also in
assets/licenses/.

6. EARLIER VERSIONS
Versions up to 1.4.3 were distributed under the PolyForm Noncommercial
License 1.0.0 and remain under that license for those who received them.
From version 1.4.4 this license applies.

7. LICENSES FOR ORGANIZATIONS
For use by organizations, contact the author through the project page:
https://github.com/Daveide90/scadenzapp
